abstract: Fifteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning thirteen Foundations/course-track mechanisms and two Modern AI extensions. v1.8.1 gives all three modern labs the same scenario-led teaching depth, plain-language discovery copy, shared header controls, and dark-theme legibility as the established suite while preserving every mechanism, assignment, language, and privacy boundary.
